    "raw_question_evidence_excerpt_en": "The council would like a city-wide recommendation. Can a two-week project in one park justify that? Only limited generalisation is possible. We can describe this park during the observation period, but not assume the same patterns hold everywhere. We'll make the limits explicit and propose a wider study rather than presenting a narrow result as universal.",
